[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織、インタビューお疲れ",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040020010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00011",
    "bgm": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサーこそ、お疲れ様でした",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200404/2002004040010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は灯織がしっかりしゃべってるのを\r\n見守ってただけだよ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "っと……雑誌のインタビューの事前アンケートも来てたな\r\n少し休憩してから頼めるか？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0099"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いえ、時間がもったいないので、今すぐ書きます",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200404/2002004040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか。じゃあ、これに記入してくれ\r\n俺はちょっとスケジュールの調整をしてるから",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0100"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\nえっと……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200404/2002004040030"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "大切なもの……\r\nプロデューサーから貰った髪飾りと書いてもいいですか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200404/2002004040040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ。それは構わないんだが……\r\nただ、誕生石をあしらった髪飾りとだけ書いてくれ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……？\r\nはい、わかりました",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200404/2002004040050"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あとは……趣味は音楽鑑賞\r\n特技は料理で……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200404/2002004040060"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "次は……えっと……\r\nあっ、この質問は……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200404/2002004040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ん？　どうした？\r\n答えたくない質問でもあったのか？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いえ……そういうわけではないんですが……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200404/2002004040080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えーっと……アイドルになったきっかけ、か？\r\nそういえば、俺も詳しくは聞いたことなかったな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そんな、大した話じゃないです",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200404/2002004040090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、興味あるな\r\n聞かせてくれないか？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……中学生の時、学園祭にアイドルが来たんです",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200404/2002004040100"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ステージの上のアイドルはキラキラ輝いていて\r\n見ている人もみんな笑顔で……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200404/2002004040110"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あんな風になれれば、自分でさえ嫌いな私でも\r\n何かを好きになれるんじゃないかって思ったんです",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200404/2002004040120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "へぇ……それが灯織にとってのきっかけだったんだな……",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……でも、なんだか不思議な気分です",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200404/2002004040130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　どうしてだ？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "たったこれだけのことなのに、少し前は\r\nプロデューサーにも話せなかったと思うんです",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200404/2002004040140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それだけ、この話が灯織にとって\r\n大切なものだってことだよ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そう、なのかもしれませんね……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200404/2002004040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それで灯織は今、何かを好きに――",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……いや、その答えは\r\n『W.I.N.G.』で優勝した時に聞かせてもらうよ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……はい、わかりました",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200404/2002004040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織、『W.I.N.G.』では……",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "悔いを残さないように\r\nしような",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "絶対に勝とうな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "灯織の思うように\r\nやってこい",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい、全力でやってきます",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200404/2002004040170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よしっその意気だ！",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい。……あの、プロデューサー\r\n今日はすぐに帰ろうと思っていたのですが……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200404/2002004040180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "レッスンだろ？\r\nそう言うと思って、押さえておいたよ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "なんだか、見透かされてるみたいで恥ずかしいですけど……\r\nありがとうございます",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200404/2002004040190"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい、負ける気はありません\r\n今まで積み重ねてきたものをぶつけてきます",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200404/2002004040200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、灯織の努力は俺が１番よく知ってる\r\nだから、絶対に大丈夫だ！",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサーに言われると\r\n本当にそんな気がしてくるから不思議です",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200404/2002004040210"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……最後まで、見ていてくださいね",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200404/2002004040220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、もちろんだ！",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私の自由にやれ、ってことですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200404/2002004040230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。『W.I.N.G.』でのステージは\r\n灯織にとって、必ず忘れられないものになると思う",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから、型にはまったようなものじゃなくて\r\n灯織がやりたいようにやればいい",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……はい、わかりました！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200404/2002004040240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺も、灯織のステージが見られるのを楽しみにしてるよ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]